abstract: "ALPS-4B (Adaptive Latent Prediction System, Four-Brain) is a multi-scale, temporally decoupled latent predictive architecture incorporating spatiotemporal tube masking, Banach checker convergence proofs, and out-of-gradient safety watchdogs for lifelong learning and system integrity."

